{
 "_about": [
  "Every live airport's silk-band palette as the board derived it from the airport's own logo, measured 2026-10-04 in headless Chrome at 1680x1050 (body --fids-band-1..4 before the v23955 end guard). null = no logo palette resolved (the band is the default navy); 'acadian' = Moncton's hand-drawn flag.",
  "geometry: the glyph boxes fids-core's band layout reads (title text, time-block text, the mark), in banner pixels, captured from the same boards. yow-departures-long-date sets the longest date of the year before the logo fit has caught up, so the mark and the date overlap there on purpose."
 ],
